</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A4.F7.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 7</span>: </span><span id="A4.F7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Cross-play performances of SRPO (<math id="A4.F7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon=0.001,\tau=0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.001</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon=0.001,\tau=0.01</annotation></semantics></math>) and IPPO (<math id="A4.F7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon=0.001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon=0.001</annotation></semantics></math>) in both <math id="A4.F7.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>2</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2</annotation></semantics></math>-player and <math id="A4.F7.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>4</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4</annotation></semantics></math>-player hanabi games. Each square represents the average reward of two agents across 50 runs of length 100.
</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A4.F8" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
